Rename.executeOne : Boolean -> Text -> [FormatPart] -> [FormatPart] -> Optional Text -> [Text] -> RenameRow ->{IO, Exception, RenameCatalog} Rename.Outcome   ~uc8bv29vdf
  ! if a CRC-tagged entry already exists at the target AND its size matches, the source is treated as a verified byte-duplicate and REMOVED (DuplicateRemoved); a CRC-tagged entry whose size does NOT match is a Conflict (left in place).
  ! writes the NFO and renames the video INTO the buffer (not the library); on success it also fetches sidecar subtitles, records promoteToBuffer, refreshes probe_cache for the new path, and deletes the old path's probe_cache row.
  ! dry-run yields WouldRename / WouldRemoveDuplicate and performs no filesystem mutation.

