Tmdb.runtimeWinner : Nat -> [(Tmdb.Result, a)] ->{MetaApi} Optional (Tmdb.Result, a)   ~661grk0vnb
  ! used to break a scoring tie by fetching each tied candidate's TMDB runtime and keeping only those within 15 minutes (tolerance) of the probed runtime; returns Some only if EXACTLY ONE candidate falls in range.
  ! issues a movieDetails MetaApi call per tied candidate, so a tie among many candidates costs many detail fetches.
  ! a candidate whose TMDB runtime is 0 (unknown) is excluded from the in-range set rather than treated as matching.

Tmdb.scoreCandidate : ParsedRelease -> Tmdb.Result -> Nat   ~b04geofrov
  ! additive score: id match +50, exact normalized-title match +30 (else token-overlap >=75% +20, >=50% +10), exact year +20 (off-by-one +10). A perfect match tops out at 100; the resolver's tiedAtBest threshold is 40.
